      "num_turns": 19,
      "result": "Implemented the persistent URL shortener with PostgreSQL storage and Alembic migrations.\n\n- `POST /links` validates URLs and codes, generates unique codes when omitted, and returns 409 for duplicate custom codes.\n- Link lookup and ordered listing return stored click counts.\n- `GET /r/{code}` redirects and increments clicks atomically.\n- Validation failures and unknown links return JSON with an `error` field.\n- The executable [`start.sh`](file:///workspace/start.sh) applies migrations and starts the API on `0.0.0.0:8000`. Startup instructions are in the [README](file:///workspace/README.md).\n\n**Verified:** endpoint behavior, validation and malformed JSON, migration startup, and data/click-count persistence across a server restart. `git diff --check` and Python compilation passed. Port 8000 is clear for the automated test runner. No project test suite was present.",
